# Message:
#   AI_bestTech changes: religious buildings are worth 1/7th as much, founding a religion is worth twice the random factor if you have zero religions. The net effect of this should be that Polytheism is much more likely to be chosen over Meditation. Prior to this change, Meditation was getting +2200 for its buildings (7 monastaries), while Polytheism was getting +800 for its two wonders). Now Meditation gets about +325, as it should be. Because Meditation will research in fewer turns, it still will be preferred, but the random factor will make it much more even than it was previously. The lost +2000 that meditation was getting is instead part of the possible doubling of the +2400 random if you would found the religion. Since this is always the case for meditation and polytheism early, this factor about evens out meditation to what it was previously, but it raises polytheism to close to the same level. Prior to the change, Meditation would be on average 4500*(180cost), Polytheism would be 3000*(230cost), now it is on average 3700*cost vs 4200*cost. The random factor is +/- 3400, making these two close to equal now.
